02:09:21.610 --> 02:09:23.270
There's also a really interesting story.

02:09:23.270 --> 02:09:25.420
We were at a conference site that just has

02:09:25.420 --> 02:09:27.570
scientific conferences all summer long,

02:09:27.570 --> 02:09:30.030
week after week, after
week, different fields.

02:09:30.030 --> 02:09:31.670
And so it's people that work there

02:09:31.670 --> 02:09:33.350
that are just dealing
with these new groups

02:09:33.350 --> 02:09:34.822
coming in week after week and the week,

02:09:34.822 --> 02:09:38.879
we were there for a microbiome conference,

02:09:38.879 --> 02:09:42.620
people that work in the dining comments

02:09:42.620 --> 02:09:43.453
came up to us and they said,

02:09:43.453 --> 02:09:45.350
"What group is this? This is weird."

02:09:45.350 --> 02:09:46.330
